# Project layout

This folder is the Spring Boot API plus Compose, Nginx, and docs. The phone app and admin console are siblings.

- API, Compose, and docs: `/home/lupo/projects/tz.co.chambaka/glyt-backend`
- Flutter **ops** app (officers): `/home/lupo/projects/tz.co.chambaka/glyt-app`
- Vue **ops** console: `/home/lupo/projects/tz.co.chambaka/glyt-admin-ui`
- Public website: `/home/lupo/projects/tz.co.chambaka/glyt-website` (travellers book / track / account here — no separate customer app)

Run Compose and `mvn spring-boot:run` from `glyt-backend`. Ops phone: `glyt-app`. Ops console: `npm run dev` in `glyt-admin-ui` (http://localhost:5180). Website: `npm run dev` in `glyt-website`.
